  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(0.032 × 0.0032) + 0.00032\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n(0.032 × 0.0032) + 0.00032\n\n⇒( 32/1000 × 32/10000) + 32/100000\n\n⇒ 1024/10000000 + 32/100000\n\n⇒ 0.0001024 + 0.00032 = 0.0004224.\n\n**Hence, the value is 0.0004224.**",
